<title>USA: USDA adds Tanzania to East Africa Region GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds Tanzania to East Africa Region GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it added Tanzania to the East Africa Region countries eligible for the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102) for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said eligible countries for the East Africa Region now include Kenya, Uganda and Tanzania.</p>
